I know everyone's concentrating on the tournament, but I finally
ascended a priestess on my local machine yesterday... when I did my
first ascension several years ago, I figured a priest might be next,
but many ascensions later and I never got it. Also, I tried to keep my
ascended monk weaponless and vegetarian, but I messed up the veg.
conduct (got weaponless with the monk though), so I wanted to get that
one checked off too.

Keeping vegetarian was tough for awhile until I stumbled into Ludios...
the C-rations and K-rations kept me fed the rest of the game.

Didn't start out with any wishless or genoless intentions specifically,
but most of my games now are genoless, and sometimes wishless. Within
two dungeon levels of each other, though, I got a fountain-water-demon
wish, and two wishes from the same throne. Sure, I could have turned
them down, but...

Never found a bag of holding laying around the entire game (Sokoban was
AoR), so it was a good thing I used one of those early wishes on it.

Stayed polyselfless and polypileless too, but neither of those are
usually part of my strategy anyway.

Found two magic markers laying around in one of the early levels too,
which helped. And a spellbook of create monster by the time I cleared
the mines. Found several altars, including a co-aligned minetown altar.

So, basically, everything went right for me this game. RNG saving up
for my next game, I suppose. :)

Did have to go to all three altars on Astral... a cockatrice corpse
helped a lot, as usual. Famine was center, Death was to the left, and
neither of those were right, so went to Pestilence on the right.
Pestilence is a pain in the ass.

Wielded Mjollnir most of the game once my god finally gave it to me
after sacrificing... he gave me Trollbane, Vorpal Blade (before being
crowned), Ogresmasher, all sorts of crap before finally giving in.
(Well, Vorpal Blade isn't too bad, but...)

I played with Asmodeus for awhile so I could kill Geryon and Dispater.
Also played with Orcus and got Yeenoghu. Thought about waiting for
Demogorgon too, but decided not to push my luck. Maybe another time.

Was granted telepathy by my god (floating eyes aren't vegetarian) when
waiting for Mjollnir I think. Lost it before the end game: apparently
zapping the high priest of Moloch with a WoDeath from outside his
temple counts as "murderer". Ah well. I got his Amulet anyway. :P

Equipment was what you'd expect... GDSM, robe, AoR, Gauntlets of Power,
the Mitre (which is better than I had thought.. #invoking for spell
points = teh win.. beats the Heart of Ahr..Arhm.. the Barbarian quest
artifact, anyway), and so on.

Don't have my copy-paste of the endgame here, but it's not that
exciting anyway. I got the "You kept vegetarian conduct", that's what I
was after. :)

So I've ascended one of every class save rogue, ranger, tourist. I've
gotten very far with a ranger on another occasion, until she died to a
cockatrice corpse somehow (I forget the specifics, but it's the highest
scoring non-ascension in my logfile). I've gotten all the conducts I'm
likely to do: genoless, wishless, weaponless (monk), vegetarian
(priest), illiterate (caveman), the poly ones. I could try atheist I
suppose. Maybe an atheist rogue..? Pacifism would require way too much
patience for me. :)



